    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aHarvesterArno\u300b is a third person automatic shooting casual grass cutting game. During battles, as the experience level increases, the firepower level can be upgraded to up to level 8. Various monsters randomly appear in the battle, and the HP and combat power of the monsters increase with the player's upgrade. The hero characters in the game will automatically shoot, and players only need to control the direction of movement. After a monster is killed, there are sometimes 6 randomly dropped items, including HP items, shield items, 2 types of firepower enhancement items, clone items, and bomb items, to assist in battles and make players more comfortable. In the level scene, there will also be random ores, and players can increase their experience points after obtaining ores. The game has two levels - desert Gobi level and wetland shrub level, each level includes two modes: simple and difficult.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aHarvesterArno\u300b is a third person automatic shooting casual grass cutting game. During battles, as the experience level increases, the firepower level can be upgraded to up to level 8. Various monsters randomly appear in the battle, and the HP and combat power of the monsters increase with the player's upgrade. The hero characters in the game will automatically shoot, and players only need to control the direction of movement. After a monster is killed, there are sometimes 6 randomly dropped items, including HP items, shield items, 2 types of firepower enhancement items, clone items, and bomb items, to assist in battles and make players more comfortable. In the level scene, there will also be random ores, and players can increase their experience points after obtaining ores. The game has two levels - desert Gobi level and wetland shrub level, each level includes two modes: simple and difficult.</p>",
    "short_description": "Harvester Arno is a third person automatic shooting casual grass cutting game with features such as an open world, random monsters, continuously increasing firepower, and simple operation. During the battle, there are items randomly dropped that can be picked up to assist in the fight.",
